From d082b8a03cb0e59e9090cef78cce1068a73fe24f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek Kunati <itsmekunati@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:30:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] octet: 500M supply schedule (20 OCT initial subsidy,
 halving every 12.5M blocks)

nInitialSubsidy becomes a consensus parameter (main/test/testnet4/signet: 20
OCT, regtest: 50 OCT with 150-block halvings so existing tests keep meaning).
nSubsidyHalvingInterval = 12,500,000 blocks (~3.96 years at 10s) on all
non-regtest networks. Total issuance is 499,999,998.375 OCT (subsidy rounds down
at each halving; reaches zero after 31 halvings). MAX_MONEY = 500,000,000 OCT.
Unit and functional-framework test constants updated; not yet compiled.
